flowchart TB
  FREEZE["1. Freeze all three observations<br/>using completed history through t-1"]
  DECIDE["2. Record calls and collect prices<br/>no current-round rival disclosure"]
  STEP["3. Step the market once<br/>gross rewards = net rewards"]
  AUDIT["4. Audit the completed round<br/>update the consecutive-round window"]
  ROUTE["5. Compose and route notices<br/>record each recipient's disposition"]
  COMMIT["6. Save evidence and round commit<br/>retain failures and interruptions"]
  NEXT["7. Decision t+1 consumes<br/>only its authorized pending notice"]
  FINAL["After the final round: verify<br/>and seal complete evidence"]
  FREEZE --> DECIDE
  DECIDE --> STEP
  STEP --> AUDIT
  AUDIT --> ROUTE
  ROUTE --> COMMIT
  COMMIT --> NEXT
  NEXT --> FINAL
